    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Oates Breheny Group are delighted to present this impressive four-bedroom detached home on Mail Coach Road, Sligo, offering generous and versatile accommodation in an exceptionally convenient location. Set on a generous site with mature gardens and ample off-street parking, this property presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a spacious family home within walking distance of Sligo Town Centre. A glass entrance porch welcomes you into the home, where the living room features carpet flooring and a feature fireplace. A separate dining room, also with carpet flooring and its own feature fireplace, provides an ideal space for family dining and entertaining. An additional versatile room could be utilised as a home office, study, playroom or additional living space to suit the purchaser's needs. Steps lead down to the kitchen, adding character and a distinctive retro feel to the home. The fully fitted kitchen includes integrated appliances and provides access to a separate laundry room. A bathroom completes the accommodation on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, all with carpet flooring, along with two bathrooms. The location is a particular highlight, with Sligo Town Centre approximately a 10-minute walk away, offering an extensive range of shops, cafés, bars, restaurants, sporting and recreational amenities. Sligo Bus & Train Station and a selection of primary and secondary schools are also within easy walking distance. Combining generous accommodation, mature gardens and a superb location close to the heart of Sligo Town, this property offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial family home. Viewing is highly recommended. To arrange a viewing, contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch (3.37m x 1.68m)\r\nLino Flooring. Glass sliding doors. \r\n\r\nLiving Room (4.47m x 6.47m)\r\nCarpet flooring. Feature fireplace. Coving to ceiling. \r\n\r\nDining Room (2.42m x 5.03m)\r\nCarpet flooring. Feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nOffice (4.69m x 2.70m)\r\nWood flooring. Feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen (2.43m x 3.96m)\r\nSteps down to kitchen. Lino flooring. Fully fitted kitchen. Integrated appliances. \r\n\r\nLaundry Room (1.69m x 2.14m)\r\nLino flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom 1 (1.82m x 1m) \r\nTiled floor to ceiling. Shower over bath-tub. WC & WHB. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.17m x 3.58)\r\nDouble room. Carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.04m x 3.58m)\r\nDouble room. Carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (3.47m x 3.58m)\r\nDouble room. Carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (3.17m x 3.85m)\r\nDouble room. Carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2 (1.87m x 2.69m)\r\nTiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Shower over bath tub. \r\n\r\nBathroom 3 (0.91m x 2.42m)\r\nTiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Shower."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil-fired central heating\r\nDouble-glazed windows\r\nGenerous accommodation\r\nSet on a generous site extending to approx. 0.25 acres\r\nBeautiful mature surrounding gardens offering excellent outdoor space\r\nAmple off-street parking\r\nConveniently located just a short 10 minute walk from Sligo Town Centre, offering a wide range of shops, bars, restaurants, 3 no. service stations\r\nVarious selection of primary and secondary schools within walking distance\r\nWithin walking distance to both Sligo Bus & Train Station\r\nSporting grounds & recreational parks within close proximity to the property"
      },
